00:01:00,720 --> 00:01:05,360
 Prevention and extinguishing of fires is reliant on breaking what's called the fire tetrahedron,

19
00:01:05,360 --> 00:01:10,640
 generally speaking all, and usually most of these four elements are needed for a fire to sustain.

20
