00:01:28,320 --> 00:01:31,840
 You need to be a little bit careful though, because there are some cases, metal fires,

26
00:01:31,840 --> 00:01:37,040
 battery fires, where the combustion reaction is actually more volatile with water than with air,

27
00:01:37,040 --> 00:01:40,240
 and so pouring water on the fire can actually make matters worse.

28
00:01:40,240 --> 00:01:44,800
 For this reason, we don't usually just wing it or rely on rules of thumb when we're trying to

29
00:01:44,800 --> 00:01:48,000
 design around prevention of fires or fight fires.

