00:02:17,520 --> 00:02:20,240
 that we need to keep in mind when designing around them.

40
00:02:20,240 --> 00:02:24,320
 The flash point of a material is the lowest temperature at which its vapors will ignite

41
00:02:24,320 --> 00:02:26,160
 when provided a source of ignition.

42
00:02:26,160 --> 00:02:29,920
 The flame point of a material is the lowest temperature at which vapors will ignite

43
00:02:29,920 --> 00:02:33,600
 and sustain a flame even when that source of ignition is removed.

44
00:02:33,600 --> 00:02:37,360
 These temperatures can be quite sensitive to the environmental conditions the pressure

