00:04:49,920 --> 00:04:55,280
 coupled with other risk factors like limited egress, poor visibility, risk of caving,

78
00:04:55,280 --> 00:04:59,680
 demands that materials are used that don't have the capability to start a fire.

79
00:04:59,760 --> 00:05:02,640
 These materials and equipment are termed intrinsically safe.

